{
  "rule": "centered_2nd_nonuniform_cartesian",
  "metric": "Linf",
  "expected_min_order": 1.9,
  "notes": "Centered 2nd-order FD second derivative on non-uniform Cartesian grid. Coefficients are 2/(dx[i]*(dx[i]+dx[i+1])), -2/(dx[i]*dx[i+1]), 2/(dx[i+1]*(dx[i]+dx[i+1])) per §6.2.1 explicit-index form, where dx[k]=x_k-x_{k-1}. Reduces to [1,-2,1]/dx^2 on uniform grids. Requires observed min order >= 1.9 on geometrically-stretched grids."
}
